# Normalise line endings.
#
# Git for Windows enables core.autocrlf=true by default, which rewrites LF to
# CRLF on checkout. Every shell script in this repository is executed inside a
# Linux container, where CRLF is fatal: a `#!/bin/bash -e\r` shebang makes the
# kernel hand bash the argument "-e\r", which aborts with
#   /bin/bash: -: invalid option
# so backend/bin/docker-entrypoint never runs and the backend container exits
# immediately. Pinning the working-tree ending to LF keeps a Windows clone
# runnable without any local git configuration.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
